Package: devjam-system-config
Version: 1.23-5
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Generic configs by devjam
 General system settings: timestamps in the shell history, default bash
 aliases and profile for new users, high-quality PipeWire resampling,
 TRIM/discard for SSDs and LUKS volumes, storage tuning, a shorter stop
 timeout for systemd user services, and switch-io to choose an I/O
 scheduler preset.
